sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Orch as Platform Orchestrator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Op as workbenches-operator<br/>Reconciler
    participant WH as Webhook Server<br/>Service 443 → 9443/TCP TLS
    participant FS as Local FS<br/>/opt/manifests → /tmp
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(monitoring NS)

    Note over Orch,FS: Flow 1 - Workbenches reconciliation
    Orch->>API: Create/update Workbenches default-workbenches<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    API-->>Op: Watch event (Workbenches)<br/>HTTPS 6443, SA token
    Op->>FS: Copy Kustomize trees, overlay RELATED_IMAGE_*,<br/>merge params, render (krusty)
    FS-->>Op: Rendered operand manifests
    Op->>API: Server-Side Apply operands, ImageStreams,<br/>CRDs, RBAC, webhook configs (SA token)
    Op->>API: Update status (ModuleStatus phase, releases)

    Note over User,WH: Flow 2 - Notebook admission (connections + hardware profile)
    User->>API: Create/Update Notebook (kubeflow.org/v1)<br/>HTTPS 6443, user Bearer token
    API->>WH: AdmissionReview POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>443→9443 HTTPS, server cert via CA bundle
    WH->>API: Get Secrets + create SubjectAccessReview<br/>(requesting user) - SA token
    API-->>WH: Secret exists / SAR allowed
    WH-->>API: JSON patch (envFrom secretRefs) or deny
    API->>WH: AdmissionReview POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>443→9443 HTTPS
    WH->>API: Get HardwareProfile, ResourceClaimTemplate,<br/>create Event - SA token
    WH-->>API: JSON patch (resources, nodeSelector, tolerations,<br/>Kueue queue-name label, resourceClaims)
    API-->>User: Notebook persisted

    Note over Prom,Op: Flow 3 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer token (TokenReview + SAR)
    Op-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
